# 🤖 SO101 Water Pouring Robot

## 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates an AI-based robotic system that learns to pour water using imitation learning.

## 🚀 Features

* Learning from human demonstrations
* Smooth pouring control
* Vision-guided behavior

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Python
* LeRobot
* PyTorch
* OpenCV

## 🎯 Task

Pick a container and pour water into another container.

## 📷 Setup

* SO101 robot arm
* Camera for observation

## 🔁 Workflow

1. Calibration
2. Teleoperation
3. Data Recording
4. Training
5. Autonomous execution


## 📊 Results

* Controlled pouring
* Reduced spillage

## 🔮 Future Work

* Liquid level detection
* Precision control using sensors
